<title>UK: Eksportfinans sets $90mln three-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Eksportfinans sets $90mln three-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager New Japan Securities Europe Ltd and IBJ International Plc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EKSPORTFINANS ASA</p>
<p> AMT    $90 MLN	 COUPON     5.32 PCT  MATURITY    21.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    21.JAN.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    UNLISTED  PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10     SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP/NOR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20 PCT  SELL CONC  1.00 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
